00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.720
can guide us.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.390
This is the spirit of Starmus Earth this year.

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:07.790
So let's celebrate our home,

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:10.840
that little blue dot in space.

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:13.830
